    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44780" root="&#xA;                        وهى&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَاهٍ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>Lax; weak: frail; wanting in strength,
compactness, firmness,</i> or <i>toughness; unsubstantial; unsound.</i> See an ex. in the S, voce
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُنْشُوطَةٌ</span>, where it is applied to love, or affection.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَاهًا</span>: see an ex. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُغْبَةٌ</span>; and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آهِ</span>, in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوه</span>, in two places.

